        <mxCell id="bbgNH6gLYLxY2o1V5HqJ-53" value="&lt;h1&gt;Integration&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Integration with online (not legacy/onprem) tools to delivery added value to the customer sales chain.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;*Productivity tools: Google docs&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* Customer service tools: Twillio&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;* AI platforms: OpenAI, Palm2&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;* Automation platforms: Zapier&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
