        <mxCell id="bbgNH6gLYLxY2o1V5HqJ-62" value="&lt;h1&gt;Value added by Wallfy.ai&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;. Increase capacity to interact with your customers&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;. Enable insights to understand your customer&#39;s intention&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;. Provide targeted communication, according to the persona, pitch strategy, and UX phase&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;. Protect your data and strategy to become public&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;. Global coverage&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="960" y="1700" width="440" height="207" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="bbgNH6gLYLxY2o1V5HqJ-67" value="&lt;h1&gt;Backoffice&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Set of tools and services to support the customers to take decisions based on the insights generated the intelligent components created by Wallfy and partners.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
