        <mxCell id="mfo0LBBkBCDeIbgj-d1y-4" value="&lt;h1&gt;Frontend services&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Those are the interfaces that we use to communicate with the end-consumers.&lt;/p&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" vertex="1" parent="1">
